    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like the silence is actually pushing down on me. you're right though, i am just going through the motions. i wake up, i stare at the ceiling, i wait for the day to be over. it feels so stupid to even try. like i'm just a ghost in this house. why does it feel like there's no way out of this feeling?",
